{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15165","headline":"奉酬崔员外副使携琴宿使院见示 · 李益","name":"奉酬崔员外副使携琴宿使院见示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽闻此夜携琴宿，遂叹常时尘吏喧。\n庭木已衰空月亮，城砧自急对霜繁。\n犹持副节留军府，未荐高词直掖垣。\n谁问南飞长绕树，官微同在谢公门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}